    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88314022701350913
    m_Localized: 下次补充：明天
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88314022701350914
    m_Localized: 二手
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88314022701350915
    m_Localized: 黑市为埃莉诺的数据盘付了你{0}信用点。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88314022701350916
    m_Localized: 帕斯泰尔营养果的秘密遭到泄露！
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88314022701350917
    m_Localized: 一篇研究论文已经发表，揭示了如何让普通营养果重新结籽。全空间站的生物黑客已经开始种植这一新品种，种子价格随之暴跌。同一天早上，因挪用公款入狱的空间站最大水培农场前负责人被发现死在牢房中。帕斯泰尔公司拒绝置评。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88314022701350918
    m_Localized: 标签页{0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88314022705545216
    m_Localized: 储物标签页：{0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575454130176
    m_Localized: 超科技走私贩
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575483490304
    m_Localized: 还没有预设。激活它来设置吧。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575483490305
    m_Localized: '{0}：{1}（{2}件物品）'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575483490306
    m_Localized: '{0}：{1}（1件物品）'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575483490307
    m_Localized: 无按键
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575483490308
    m_Localized: 输出：每周期{0} kJ，无限
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575483490309
    m_Localized: 升级：电子元件（超科技），每个+{0} kJ输出（已使用{1}个）
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575483490310
    m_Localized: 已连接：{0}（{1}kJ）
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575483490311
    m_Localized: 机器耗电在输出范围内
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575483490312
    m_Localized: 机器耗电超出输出：无法供电
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575483490313
    m_Localized: 充能：{0}/{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575483490314
    m_Localized: 已储存加速：{0}次
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575483490315
    m_Localized: 充能速度：每周期{0}（等级{1}），从能量电池汲取{0} kJ
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575483490316
    m_Localized: 对它使用一个高级涡轮增压器，可永久提高充能速度和耗电量。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575487684608
    m_Localized: 充能：{0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575487684609
    m_Localized: 冷却：还剩{0}天
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575487684610
    m_Localized: 冷却：还剩1天
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575487684611
    m_Localized: 就绪
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88617575487684612
    m_Localized: 对它使用电子元件（超科技）可增加1次充能。
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
